---@field knowledgeBaseId aws.wisdom.UuidOrArn The identifier of the knowledge base. This should not be a QUICK_RESPONSES type knowledge base if you're storing Wisdom Content resource to it. Can be either the ID or the ARN
---@field contentId aws.wisdom.UuidOrArn The identifier of the content. Can be either the ID or the ARN. URLs cannot contain the ARN.
---@field revisionId? aws.wisdom.NonEmptyString The revisionId of the content resource to update, taken from an earlier call to GetContent, GetContentSummary, SearchContent, or ListContents. If included, this argument acts as an optimistic lock to ensure content was not modified since it was last read. If it has been modified, this API throws a PreconditionFailedException.
---@field title? aws.wisdom.ContentTitle The title of the content.
---@field overrideLinkOutUri? aws.wisdom.Uri The URI for the article. If the knowledge base has a templateUri, setting this argument overrides it for this piece of content. To remove an existing overrideLinkOurUri, exclude this argument and set removeOverrideLinkOutUri to true.
